            "page_id": "pg_same_number",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "presentation_class": "official",
            "text": "The round is one number for the whole channel. Four stilt houses, one count, and the count is not allowed to differ by house.",
            "advance": "auto"
        },
        {
            "page_id": "pg_waterline",
            "speaker": "world",
            "presentation_class": "narration",
            "text": "The waterline mark on the piling sits a hand above the last painted band. Nobody has repainted the band.",
            "advance": "wait"
        },
        {
            "page_id": "pg_who_owns_count",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "presentation_class": "confidential",
            "text": "I file the number you hand me. If the number is wrong, the wrongness is filed under my name and the thirst is still yours.",
            "advance": "auto"
        }
    ],
